  "question": {
    "text": "The IUPAC nomenclature of an element with electronic configuration <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>Rn</mi></mfenced><mn>5</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>14</mn></msup><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mn>7</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is"
